<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Teco 9-mth pre-tax net down 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Teco 9-mth pre-tax net down 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			   (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    15,010 vs 15,170</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     898 vs  1,568</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     1,426 vs  1,990</p>
<p>NOTE - Teco Electric and Machinery Company Ltd is one of Taiwan's leading electric appliance and electric machinery makers. A company spokesman attributed the profit decline to a sluggish local economy and slow progress in domestic public construction projects.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
